---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disaster Recovery Testing">
  <main>
    <h1>Disaster Recovery Testing Platform</h1>

    <p>
      A practical disaster recovery engineering exercise for validating that
      homelab services can be rebuilt, restored and verified after a major
      infrastructure failure.
    </p>

    <h2>Objectives</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Validate backup restoration procedures using a clean Raspberry Pi 4.</li>
      <li>Test Restic recovery workflows and configuration recovery.</li>
      <li>Measure recovery time objectives and document lessons learned.</li>
      <li>Confirm monitoring, security and service validation after recovery.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Technology</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Restic backups</li>
      <li>Linux recovery procedures</li>
      <li>Docker and container platforms</li>
      <li>K3s recovery validation</li>
      <li>Prometheus and Grafana operational checks</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>Planned recovery exercise using replacement Raspberry Pi hardware.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
